    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what is our company's strategy for meeting these sustainability requirements, and how will our company's ensure that all environmental aspects are properly addressed?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these sustainability requirements, our company's strategy will focus on leveraging our company's existing capabilities and commitments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's will highlight our company's current EcoVadis Silver rating of 62, demonstrating our company's dedication to environmental responsibility.  our company's will also emphasize our company's green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with the client's requirement for low carbon impact infrastructures. our company's digital sobriety practices will play a crucial role in reducing energetic consumption. our company's will implement practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputation by an estimated 20%, and adhering to a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle. our company's are committed to reducing our company's carbon footprint, having already conducted a bilan carbone in 2023, which reported a total Scope 1 & 2 tCO2e of 148. our company's aim to achieve net zero by 2040 and will work towards minimizing our energy consumption throughout the project. our company's social commitments, including a strong gender equality index of 88, disabled workers representation of 4.2%, and preference for local subcontracting, demonstrate our company's dedication to socially responsible practices that can indirectly support environmental sustainability by promoting fairness and equity in our company's operations. our company's AI ethics principles, which include human oversight, non-discrimination, transparency, and the right to contest AI-generated suggestions, will ensure that our company's technological solutions are not only environmentally friendly but also ethically sound." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address known sustainability trade-offs, such as balancing high availability with energy consumption, our company's have standard resolutions in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, our company's use low-power standby modes with wake-up times under 90 seconds, which is compatible with our company's SLA requirements. our company's also recommend that clients subscribe to renewable energy Guarantee of Origin certificates for on-premise servers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating these strategies and commitments into our company's project approach, our company's will ensure that all environmental aspects are properly addressed, contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and limiting the environmental footprint, as required by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering proposes an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents administrative activities, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and integrating with existing systems of information." ;
