    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution, based on the Mistral 7B Instruct model, will have fine-tuning methods such as LORA and QLoRA, incorporating retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities for explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution, based on the Mistral 7B Instruct model aims to achieve high accuracy, with an expected gain of 12%, and provide transparent and reliable results." ;
