    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, what are the potential legal risks and liabilities associated with The proposed solution, and how will our company's ensure that all contractual requirements are properly addressed?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client requirements and our company's company context, the potential legal risks and liabilities associated with this project solution include non-compliance with EU regulatory requirements, particularly the GDPR and AI Act, as well as environmental regulations. our company's experience in public procurement across EU jurisdictions will help navigate these complexities." ;
